                    given: "Wave equation \\( y(x, t) = 0.06\\sin(50\\pi t - 2.5\\pi x) \\).",
                    find: "Propagation direction, wave number (\\( k \\)), angular frequency (\\( \\omega \\)), and wave speed (\\( v \\)) in \\( \\mathrm{m/s} \\).",
