                    given: "Slit separation \\( d = 2.0 \\times 10^{-4}\\,\\mathrm{m} \\), Angle \\( \\theta = 0.30^\\circ \\) (\\( \\sin 0.30^\\circ \\approx 5.236 \\times 10^{-3} \\)).",
