                    given: "Slit separation \\( d = 2.0 \\times 10^{-4}\\,\\mathrm{m} \\), Screen distance \\( L = 1.60\\,\\mathrm{m} \\), Distance for 4 fringe intervals \\( 4\\Delta y = 20.0\\,\\mathrm{mm} \\implies \\Delta y = 5.0\\,\\mathrm{mm} = 5.0 \\times 10^{-3}\\,\\mathrm{m} \\).",
