                    finalAnswer: "\\theta_1 = 8.0 \\times 10^{-3}\\,\\mathrm{rad} \\; (0.458^\\circ), \\quad \\theta_2 = 1.60 \\times 10^{-2}\\,\\mathrm{rad} \\; (0.917^\\circ)",
