                    correctIndex: 0,
                    feedback: "<strong>Step-by-step Solution:</strong><br>1. <strong>Given:</strong> Initial velocity \\( u = 0 \\), Acceleration \\( a = 4.00\\,\\mathrm{m/s^2} \\), Specified second \\( n = 5 \\).<br>2. <strong>Find:</strong> Displacement in 5th second \\( s_5 \\).<br>3. <strong>Equation:</strong> \\( s_n = u + \\frac{1}{2}a(2n - 1) \\).<br>4. <strong>Unit conversion:</strong> Standard SI units.<br>5. <strong>Rearrangement:</strong> Direct substitution.<br>6. <strong>Substitution:</strong> \\( s_5 = 0 + \\frac{1}{2}(4.00)(2 \\times 5 - 1) \\).<br>7. <strong>Calculation:</strong> Bracket: \\( 2(5) - 1 = 9 \\); \\( s_5 = 2.00 \\times 9 = 18.0\\,\\mathrm{m} \\).<br>8. <strong>Final Answer:</strong> \\( 18.0\\,\\mathrm{m} \\).<br>9. <strong>Explanation:</strong> Alternatively, distance in first 5 s (50 m) minus distance in first 4 s (32 m) equals 18.0 m."
