                    find: "Buoyant force (\\( F_B \\)).",
                    equation: "F_B = \\rho_{\\text{air}} g V",
                    rearrangement: "F_B = 1.25 \\times 9.80 \\times 1500",
                    solution: "1. Mass of displaced air: \\( 1.25 \\times 1500 = 1875\\,\\mathrm{kg} \\).<br>2. Upward buoyant force: \\( F_B = 1875 \\times 9.80 = 18{,}375\\,\\mathrm{N} \\approx 18.4\\,\\mathrm{kN} \\).",
                    finalAnswer: "F_B = 18{,}375\\,\\mathrm{N} \\approx 18.4\\,\\mathrm{kN}",
