                    correctIndex: 0,
                    feedback: "<strong>Correct Answer:</strong> Perpendicular force per unit contact area, measured in Pascals (1 Pa = 1 N/m²).<br><strong>Explanation:</strong> Pressure is defined as normal force per unit area (\\( P = \\frac{F}{A} \\)). One Pascal equals one Newton distributed over one square meter."
