                    given: "\\( V = 0.0500\\,\\mathrm{m^3}, n = 2.00\\,\\mathrm{mol}, T = 300.0\\,\\mathrm{K}, R = 8.314\\,\\mathrm{J/(mol\\cdot K)} \\).",
