                    given: "\\( q_1 = +3.0\\,\\mu\\mathrm{C} \\) at \\( (0, 0.30\\,\\mathrm{m}) \\), \\( q_2 = +4.0\\,\\mu\\mathrm{C} \\) at \\( (0.40\\,\\mathrm{m}, 0) \\), \\( q_0 = +1.0\\,\\mu\\mathrm{C} \\) at \\( (0, 0) \\).",
                    find: "Net force magnitude \\( F_{\\text{net}} \\).",
