                    rearrangement: "F_y = \\frac{9.0 \\times 10^9 \\times 3.0 \\times 10^{-6} \\times 1.0 \\times 10^{-6}}{0.30^2}, \\quad F_x = \\frac{9.0 \\times 10^9 \\times 4.0 \\times 10^{-6} \\times 1.0 \\times 10^{-6}}{0.40^2}",
                    solution: "1. <strong>Vertical force F_y (downward, -y):</strong> \\( F_y = \\frac{0.027}{0.090} = 0.30\\,\\mathrm{N} \\).<br>2. <strong>Horizontal force F_x (leftward, -x):</strong> \\( F_x = \\frac{0.036}{0.160} = 0.225\\,\\mathrm{N} \\).<br>3. <strong>Resultant magnitude:</strong> \\( F_{\\text{net}} = \\sqrt{(0.225)^2 + (0.30)^2} = \\sqrt{0.050625 + 0.0900} = \\sqrt{0.140625} = 0.375\\,\\mathrm{N} \\).",
                    finalAnswer: "F_{\\text{net}} = 0.375\\,\\mathrm{N} \\approx 0.38\\,\\mathrm{N}",
